# Terraform working files. State lives in S3; lock files (.terraform.lock.hcl) are committed.
# The bootstrap's variables hold your alert email; the repository is public. (The prod
# stack's terraform.tfvars is committed: CI reads it, and it holds no secrets.)
/terraform/bootstrap/terraform.tfvars
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
*_override.tf
# Kill-switch Lambda package, built by Terraform.
/build/

# Working plan, kept local on purpose.
DEPLOYMENT_PLAN.md
# Prompts given to the agents: working material, not part of the platform.
prompts/

# Local AWS settings for the Makefile.
platform.env

# Editor settings, and stray archives from trying the services by hand (also *.zip above).
.idea/
out.zip

# Benchmark output (make perf).
/perf/results/

# Working material, kept local: the exercise brief and its prompt, notes, scratch commands.
